Options -Indexes

ErrorDocument 401 /utility/errors/401.php
ErrorDocument 403 /utility/errors/403.php
ErrorDocument 404 /utility/errors/404.php
ErrorDocument 500 /utility/errors/500.php


DirectoryIndex index.php

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.+)\.htm$ http://localhost/$1.php [R,NC]
RewriteRule ^(.+)\.html$ http://localhost/$1.php [R,NC]
RewriteRule ^online/([0-9]+) online.php?svr=$1 [NC]